@startuml fig_3_3_mlp_architecture
' Рисунок 3.X — Архитектура многослойного перцептрона
' Глава 3, §3.3 · классическая схема (схематичное представление)

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam packageBorderStyle dashed
skinparam packageBorderColor #8B0000
skinparam packageFontColor #8B0000
skinparam packageBackgroundColor white
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam usecaseBorderColor black
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam NoteBorderColor #8B0000
skinparam NoteFontColor #8B0000

title Рисунок 3.X — Архитектура MLP\n(website: 75 → 128 → 64 → 12)

' ── Слои (пунктирные рамки, как в учебной схеме) ──

package " " as P1 {
  () " " as in0
  () " " as in1
  () " " as in2
}
note bottom of P1 : **входной слой**\n(n = 75)

package " " as P2 {
  () " " as h10
  () " " as h11
  () " " as h12
}
note bottom of P2 : **скрытый слой 1**\n128 · ReLU

package " " as P3 {
  () " " as h20
  () " " as h21
  () " " as h22
}
note bottom of P3 : **скрытый слой 2**\n64 · ReLU

package " " as P4 {
  () " " as out0
  () " " as out1
}
note bottom of P4 : **выходной слой**\n12 · Softmax

' ── Внешние входы / выход ──

() " " as gin0 #white;line:white
() " " as gin1 #white;line:white
() " " as gout #white;line:white

gin0 -right-> in0 : **вход**<sub>0</sub>
gin1 -right-> in1 : **вход**<sub>1</sub>
out0 -right-> gout : **выход**<sub>0</sub>

' ── Полносвязные связи между слоями ──

in0 --> h10
in0 --> h11
in0 --> h12
in1 --> h10
in1 --> h11
in1 --> h12
in2 --> h10
in2 --> h11
in2 --> h12

h10 --> h20
h10 --> h21
h10 --> h22
h11 --> h20
h11 --> h21
h11 --> h22
h12 --> h20
h12 --> h21
h12 --> h22

h20 --> out0
h20 --> out1
h21 --> out0
h21 --> out1
h22 --> out0
h22 --> out1

note as N1 #FFFDE7
  Схема упрощена для наглядности.
  Фактическая топология: **75 → 128 → 64 → 12**
  (one-hot вектор ответов опроса)
end note

@enduml
